  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainability of Services for Key Populations in Eastern Europe and Central Asia (&quot;EECA&quot;) - World - Multicountry HIV EECA APH (01-Jan-2025-31-Dec-2027)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multicountry HIV EECA APH, HIV, International Charitable Foundation &#x201c;Alliance for Public Health&#x201d; (Alliance for Public Health)This program has the following goals: To contribute to a sustainable and significant reduction of infection, illness and death by HIV/AIDS in the EECA region. The objectives of this program are: Enhancing the uptake of HIV prevention opportunities among Key Populations in the EECA region and improving the HIV care cascade.  Removing human rights-related barriers to HIV services for Key Populations in the EECA region.  Increasing the capacity of EECA health systems and investments into HIV responses for sustainable epidemic control</narrative>
  </description>
